-- Two operands of an enumerable `++`, each a call to the same reusable helper.
-- The tag that lets the enumerate-both clause fire has to be derived through the
-- application (task enumerable-injf-operand-loses-tag-across-apply); before that,
-- both operands carried no DiscreteValues and the `++` had no clause at all.
sel x = if x then 1 else 0
fl = Uniform < 0.5
main = sel fl ++ sel fl
